---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ava-mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ava-mission-grid">
      <div class="ava-mission-txt">
        <div class="eyebrow">Alabama Veteran Initiative</div>
        <h2>Built for <span class="red">Vets.</span><br />By Vets.</h2>
        <p>
          Too many veterans lose their sense of purpose and community after service ends. The
          transition to civilian life can be isolating — and that isolation has real consequences
          for mental health and well-being.
        </p>
        <p>
          AV Active is a digital hub designed around the way veterans actually live. It brings
          together peer communication, fitness tracking, wellness resources, PTG programming, and
          real community events in one place — keeping Alabama vets engaged in a positive,
          productive way.
        </p>
        <p>
          Corporate sponsors can connect with and support veterans through the app, helping track
          impact and fund activities that make a real difference.
        </p>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="btn-b"
          onclick="
              openContact('avactive@alabamaveteran.org', 'AV Active', 'AV Active Inquiry from');
              return false;
            "
          >Learn More</a
        >
      </div>
      <div class="ava-mission-img">
        <img
          src={`${base}assets/6ed7672bcae5ea4d.webp`}
          alt="Veterans on the move at AV Active event"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
